    "id": "immobili",
    "nome": "Immobili in evidenza",
    "enabled": true,
    "html": "<div class=\"gc\"><section class=\"gc-sec\" id=\"immobili\"><div class=\"gc-wrap\"><div class=\"im-head\"><div><p class=\"gc-eyebrow\">Properties</p><h2 class=\"gc-h2\">Featured selection</h2></div><a class=\"gc-btn gc-btn-k\" href=\"__BASEURL__/en/contact/\">Request a tailored search</a></div><div class=\"gc-plat\"><a class=\"gc-pl im-card\" href=\"__BASEURL__/en/contact/?immobile=villa-vendita\"><img class=\"im-ph\" src=\"__BASEURL__/assets/foto/agenzia/casa-giardino.jpg\" width=\"800\" height=\"600\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"Villa in Mentana with a garden\"><span class=\"gc-eyebrow\">For sale</span><b>Three-storey villa with garden</b><p>Mentana, Mezzaluna area</p><ul class=\"im-meta\"><li>3 floors</li><li>9 bedrooms</li><li>6 bathrooms</li></ul><span class=\"im-price\">&#8364;500,000 with farmland</span></a><a class=\"gc-pl im-card\" href=\"__BASEURL__/en/contact/?immobile=villa-affitto\"><img class=\"im-ph\" src=\"__BASEURL__/assets/foto/agenzia/casa-giardino.jpg\" width=\"800\" height=\"600\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"Villa in Mentana with a garden\"><span class=\"gc-eyebrow\">For rent</span><b>Villa or single floors for rent</b><p>Mentana, Mezzaluna area</p><ul class=\"im-meta\"><li>18 beds</li><li>3 apartments</li><li>Garden</li></ul><span class=\"im-price\">Price on request</span></a><a class=\"gc-pl im-card\" href=\"__BASEURL__/en/contact/?immobile=terreno\"><img class=\"im-ph\" src=\"__BASEURL__/assets/foto/agenzia/casa-giardino.jpg\" width=\"800\" height=\"600\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"Farmland\"><span class=\"gc-eyebrow\">For sale</span><b>Farmland of about 600 m&#178;</b><p>Mentana, next to the villa</p><ul class=\"im-meta\"><li>About 600 m&#178;</li><li>Farmland</li></ul><span class=\"im-price\">Included with the villa</span></a></div><p class=\"gc-lead\">More properties coming soon. Looking for something specific? Describe your search.</p></div></section></div>"
  },
  {
    "id": "servizi",
    "nome": "Servizi",
    "enabled": true,
    "html": "<div class=\"gc\"><section class=\"gc-sec gc-soft\" id=\"servizi\"><div class=\"gc-wrap\"><p class=\"gc-eyebrow\">Services</p><h2 class=\"gc-h2\">Everything a property sale needs</h2><p class=\"gc-lead\">From the valuation to the handing over of the keys, every step handled by professionals.</p><div class=\"gc-plat im-3\"><div class=\"gc-pl\"><b>Buying and selling</b><p>Search, viewings, negotiation and assistance up to the deed.</p></div><div class=\"gc-pl\"><b>Free valuation</b><p>A reasoned estimate of the value, based on area, condition and market.</p></div><div class=\"gc-pl\"><b>Rentals</b><p>Rental contracts, including temporary ones, with full management.</p></div><div class=\"gc-pl\"><b>Mortgages and loans</b><p>Advice with a credit broker and a feasibility check.</p></div><div class=\"gc-pl\"><b>Home staging</b><p>Preparing the home to show it at its best and sell sooner.</p></div><div class=\"gc-pl\"><b>Photos and virtual tour</b><p>Professional photography, video and virtual tour.</p></div><div class=\"gc-pl\"><b>Legal and notary advice</b><p>Checking documents, offers, preliminary contracts and dealing with the notary.</p></div><div class=\"gc-pl\"><b>Land registry and energy certificate</b><p>Searches, floor plans, compliance and the energy performance certificate.</p></div><div class=\"gc-pl\"><b>Renovations</b><p>Projects and quotes with trusted professionals.</p></div></div></div></section></div>"
  },
  {
    "id": "vendi",
    "nome": "Vendi",
    "enabled": true,
    "html": "<div class=\"gc\"><section class=\"gc-sec\" id=\"vendi\"><div class=\"gc-wrap\"><div class=\"gc-2c\"><div><p class=\"gc-eyebrow\">Sell with us</p><h2 class=\"gc-h2\">How much is your home worth?</h2><p class=\"gc-lead\">We give you a free valuation and a clear sales plan: price, timing, promotion and viewings.</p><ul class=\"gc-list\"><li><b>Realistic estimate</b> based on actual prices in the area.</li><li><b>Careful promotion</b> with professional photos and listings on the main portals.</li><li><b>Selected viewings</b>, only with qualified buyers.</li><li><b>Assistance up to the deed</b>, documents included.</li></ul><p style=\"margin-top:1.5rem\"><a class=\"gc-btn gc-btn-a\" href=\"__BASEURL__/en/sell/\">Request the valuation</a></p></div><div><img class=\"im-ph\" src=\"__BASEURL__/assets/foto/agenzia/casa-moderna.jpg\" width=\"1400\" height=\"933\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"House with a pool and a garden\"></div></div></div></section></div>"
  },
  {
    "id": "mutui",
    "nome": "Mutui",
    "enabled": true,
    "html": "<div class=\"gc\"><section class=\"gc-sec gc-soft\" id=\"mutui\"><div class=\"gc-wrap\"><div class=\"gc-2c\"><div><img class=\"im-ph\" src=\"__BASEURL__/assets/foto/agenzia/chiavi-rogito.jpg\" width=\"1400\" height=\"935\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"House keys and a small model house\"></div><div><p class=\"gc-eyebrow\">Mortgages</p><h2 class=\"gc-h2\">The right mortgage, before choosing the home</h2><p class=\"gc-lead\">With a credit broker you check how much you can borrow and compare bank offers before making an offer.</p><ul class=\"gc-list\"><li><b>Pre-qualification</b> based on your income situation.</li><li><b>Comparison</b> between fixed, variable and mixed rates.</li><li><b>Application followed</b> through to payout.</li></ul><p style=\"margin-top:1.5rem\"><a class=\"gc-btn gc-btn-a\" href=\"__BASEURL__/en/contact/\">Talk to an adviser</a></p></div></div></div></section></div>"
  },
  {
    "id": "metodo",
    "nome": "Come lavoriamo",
    "enabled": true,
    "html": "<div class=\"gc\"><section class=\"gc-sec\" id=\"metodo\"><div class=\"gc-wrap\"><p class=\"gc-eyebrow\">How we work</p><h2 class=\"gc-h2\">Four steps, one point of contact</h2><ol class=\"im-steps\"><li><b>Listening</b><span>We understand what you are looking for or want to sell.</span></li><li><b>Strategy</b><span>Price, timing and promotion channels.</span></li><li><b>Negotiation</b><span>Viewings, offers and negotiation.</span></li><li><b>The deed</b><span>Documents, notary and handing over of the keys.</span></li></ol></div></section></div>"
  },
